- ✅ ISSUE-018: Frontend unit test implementation (closed 2025-10-28)
- ✅ ISSUE-023: Fixed 7/8 test failures (closed 2025-10-28)
- ✅ ISSUE-024: All components now >75% coverage (closed 2025-10-28)
